+  // Redoubt (LW-M7-39): in privacy mode Widevine first asks the page for its
+  // service certificate (message 0x08 0x04). Once the response is provided,
+  // the CDM signals EVENT_KEY_REQUIRED with empty data and HandleEvent() makes
+  // the real license request. Android 12 and 13 drop that event (see
